Vendor [soft_smile]: Take a fig. There's more than anyone can carry. #line:ch02_bark_market_listen_001
Rhen [smile]: For the crew who's leaving? #line:ch02_bark_market_listen_002
Vendor [neutral]: For whoever's hungry. Go on. #line:ch02_bark_market_listen_003
